    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this excellent 3 bed, 2.5 bath end of terrace house plus large attic conversion in a nice development in a convenient location.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises of entrance hall, guest wc, livingroom, kitchen/dining room. On the first floor there are 3 bedrooms, ensuite and bathroom. Plus on the 2nd floor there is a large attic conversion. There is a private rear garden.\n\nHouse; 105.5sqm / 1,135sqft approx.\nAttic; 22sqm / 237sqft approx.\nTOTAL; 127.5 sqm / 1,372 sqft approx.\n\n\nLocation is excellent, set in a quiet cul de sac facing a nice green space, plus there is a secure, communal landscaped courtyard behind the house too. There are a host of local amenities including schools, shops, parks, sports & leisure facilities. Plus, good public transport connections."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.3m x 2.25m\nWelcoming entrance hall featuring laminate effect timber flooring and a convenient storage closet.\n\nLiving Room - 2.85m x 5.4m\nBright and spacious living room featuring wooden flooring, a front-facing window and a fireplace with a gas fire insert.\n\nKitchen/dining Room - 4.7m x 4.2m\nFitted kitchen featuring wooden cabinetry. Integrated appliances include an oven, gas hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, and fridge/freezer. The room is plumbed for a washing machine and features tiled flooring, a tiled splashback, and benefits from direct access to the rear garden through a glass sliding door.\n\nGuest WC - 1.5m x 1.7m\nGuest WC featuring tiled flooring, a WC, and wash hand basin.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - \nCarpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.7m x 4.0m\nSpacious double bedroom with carpet flooring, extensive built-in wardrobes spanning the full length of the room, and two rear-facing windows overlooking the rear.\n\nEnsuite - 2.0m x 1.6m\nEn suite featuring tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, complete with a WC, wash hand basin, and corner shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.1m 3.2m\nFront-facing double bedroom featuring carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.5m x 3.5m\nFront-facing double bedroom featuring carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - \nFamily bathroom featuring tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, complete with a WC, wash hand basin, and bath with overhead shower.\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nAttic - 4.5m x 4.6m\nSpacious attic room featuring laminate-effect timber flooring, three Velux windows and generous eaves storage on both sides.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront garden - \nThe property is approached by a paved pathway bordered by mature planting. The property benefits from a designated car parking space.\n\nRear garden - \nThe fully enclosed rear garden features a paved patio area, a well-maintained lawn, and a rear gate providing direct access to the communal green space.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 bed, 2.5 bath.</li><li>End of terrace house.</li><li>Large Attic Conversion.</li><li>Gas fired central heating.</li><li>uPVC double glazed windows.</li><li>Alarm.</li><li>1 x designated parking spaces #22 plus visitor parking.</li><li>Private rear garden.</li><li>Secure communal courtyard.</li><li>House; 105.5sqm / 1,135sqft approx.</li><li>Attic; 22sqm / 237sqft approx.</li><li>TOTAL; 127.5 sqm / 1,372 sqft approx.</li><li></li><li>Mgt Fee approx. 900pa</ul>"
      },
